{"title":"Starship","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/973066838/0/marginalrevolution~Starship.html","date":1794831534000,"content":"<p>My favorite commentary on SpaceX’s historic catching of Starship was this:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>…we may be certain of this: for all but a vanishingly brief instant near the dawn of history, the word ‘ship’ will mean ‘spaceship.’</p>\r\n<p>Arthur C. Clarke (1965).</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Yesterday, this became vividly real to me.</p>\r\n<p>Hat tip: <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/andreaesposito/status/2121729721180574127?a=TLdsHwJv1s8ZZNIKZgs&amp;s=61\">@amdreaesposito</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>Addendum</strong>: <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/tslaming/status/2121962699932451057?a=uotNPkUiE3eIJDN-Se0&amp;s=61\">Good post</a> on why catching Starship was a super leap over catching Superheavy.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/starship.html\">Starship</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/973066838/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/973066838/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/973066838/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/973066838/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/973066838/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedbli